!## Alexa Fluor 488 C5-maleimide attached to Cys (Cys part identical to RESI CYS)
!## dye beads A01-A18 follow the numbering of the A488 mapping figure (there is no A10); HyRes bead types:
!##   A01,A02 M07 imide C(=O) | A03 C3E N-CH2 | A04 A2V (CH2)3 | A05 M03 CH2-NH-C(=O)
!##   A06,A07,A08 A4H phenyl | A09 QaD COO(-) | A11 XAN xanthene C9 (stacking) | A12,A18 A4H CH=CH
!##   A13,A16 P1W C-NH2 (+0.5 each) | A14,A17 MSO C-SO3(-) | A15 A4H C-O-C
!##   M07, M03 and MSO are metabolome types (top_metabolome.inp)
RESI A48    -2.00000
GROU
ATOM N    NH1     0.00
ATOM H    H       0.00
ATOM CA   C1E     0.00
GROU
ATOM CB   P1C     0.00
GROU
ATOM A01  M07     0.00
ATOM A02  M07     0.00
ATOM A03  C3E     0.00
ATOM A04  A2V     0.00
ATOM A05  M03     0.00
GROU
ATOM A06  A4H     0.00
ATOM A07  A4H     0.00
ATOM A08  A4H     0.00
ATOM A09  QaD    -1.00
GROU
ATOM A11  XAN     0.00
ATOM A12  A4H     0.00
ATOM A13  P1W     0.50
ATOM A14  MSO    -1.00
ATOM A15  A4H     0.00
ATOM A16  P1W     0.50
ATOM A17  MSO    -1.00
ATOM A18  A4H     0.00
GROU
ATOM C    C       0.00
ATOM O    O       0.00
BOND N    CA        CA   C         C    +N        C    O         N    H
BOND CA   CB
! dye: succinimide ring, linker, phenyl ring
BOND CB   A01       A01  A02       A01  A03       A02  A03       A03  A04
BOND A04  A05       A05  A06       A06  A07       A06  A08       A07  A08
BOND A07  A09       A08  A11
! dye: xanthene, left ring A11-A12-A13-A14-A15, right ring A11-A18-A16-A17-A15, triangulated through A15
BOND A11  A12       A12  A13       A13  A14       A14  A15       A11  A15
BOND A12  A15       A13  A15
BOND A11  A18       A18  A16       A16  A17       A17  A15       A18  A15
BOND A16  A15
ANGL -C   N    H         -C   N    CA         H    N    CA
ANGL N    CA   C          C    CA   CB
ANGL CA   C    O         CA   C    +N         O    C    +N
! dye
ANGL CA   CB   A01       CB   A01  A02       CB   A01  A03
ANGL A01  A03  A04       A02  A03  A04       A03  A04  A05       A04  A05  A06
ANGL A05  A06  A07       A05  A06  A08       A06  A07  A09       A08  A07  A09
ANGL A06  A08  A11       A07  A08  A11       A08  A11  A12       A08  A11  A18
IMPH N    -C   CA   H         C    CA   +N   O         CA   N    C    CB
! dye: keep the xanthene planar
IMPH A15  A11  A12  A13       A15  A12  A13  A14
IMPH A15  A11  A18  A16       A15  A18  A16  A17
CMAP -C   N    CA   C         N    CA   C    +N


!## Alexa Fluor 594 C5-maleimide attached to Cys (Cys part identical to RESI CYS)
!## dye beads A01-A23 follow the numbering of the A594 mapping figure; HyRes bead types:
!##   A01,A02 M07 imide C(=O) | A03 C3E N-CH2 | A04 A2V (CH2)3 | A05 M03 CH2-NH-C(=O)
!##   A06,A07,A08 A4H phenyl | A09 QaD COO(-) | A10 XAN xanthene C9 (stacking) | A11,A23 A4H ring C2H
!##   A16,A18 A4H ring C2 next to N | A17 A4H C-O-C | A15,A19 M06 N(+)-CH3 (+0.5 each)
!##   A14,A20 A2V C(CH3)2 | A12,A21 A2Y C=CH | A13,A22 MSO CH2-SO3(-)
!##   M07, M03, M06 and MSO are metabolome types (top_metabolome.inp)
RESI A59    -2.00000
GROU
ATOM N    NH1     0.00
ATOM H    H       0.00
